6fe","title":"4. PARTIJNUMMER","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Lot:</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029885","display":"4. PARTIJNUMMER"}]}},{"id":"77e5ea26-5a4d-ee11-be6e-000d3aaa06fe","title":"5. OTHER","text":{"status":"generated","div":"<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Steriele spuit en steriele naalden voor &#233;&#233;nmalig gebruik.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Ter bereiding van de suspensie met Pamorelin 3,75 mg.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Voor s.c. of i.m. injectie.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Controleer de blisterverpakking v&#243;&#243;r gebruik op beschadiging.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Volg nauwgezet de instructies beschreven in de bijsluiter op.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">Uitsluitend te gebruiken met meegeleverde naalden.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">&#160;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">De spuit en naalden dienen onmiddellijk na gebruik weggegooid te worden om misbruik of verwondingen te vermijden. Niet hergebruiken!</p></div>"},"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000029886","display":"5. OTHER"}]}}],"code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://spor.ema.europa.eu/v1/lists/200000029659/terms/","code":"200000